  "description": "Capture the essence of traditional artistry with Kaze Japanese, a stylish display typeface that embodies a “spirited-and-cultural” soul. This font features expressive, brush-inspired letterforms characterized by rhythmic, sharp terminals and fluid strokes that mimic the graceful movement of classical Japanese calligraphy. With its bold structural weight and authentic East Asian aesthetic, Kaze Japanese is the premier choice for independent sushi restaurant branding, martial arts studio logos, travel agency promotions, and high-impact “heritage-meets-modern” social media headers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Capture the essence of traditional artistry with Kaze Japanese, a stylish display typeface that embodies a “spirited-and-cultural” soul. This font features expressive, brush-inspired letterforms characterized by rhythmic, sharp terminals and fluid strokes that mimic the graceful movement of classical Japanese calligraphy. With its bold structural weight and authentic East Asian aesthetic, Kaze Japanese is the premier choice for independent sushi restaurant branding, martial arts studio logos, travel agency promotions, and high-impact “heritage-meets-modern” social media headers.</p>",
